WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Dhalsim falls after the prerequisite Arm follow-up.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.100
Dhalsim guards the Pillar while medium Cruel Shoulder whiffs to his left.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.000
Dhalsim uses the recorded parry attempt.

4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.200
Light Ghastly Interrogation catches the parry with Punish Counter.

5
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.200
The command throw ends with a hard knockdown.
